{
  "name": "Competitor hiring tracker: new roles from career sites to Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Competitor hiring tracker\nEvery Monday, checks the career sites of the companies you watch (Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby, Workable, SmartRecruiters and more) and adds new roles to a sheet. The first run adds every current opening; after that only roles posted since the last run. Hiring is the earliest public signal of a new product, market or team.\n\n**Setup (2 minutes)**\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your API token (Apify Console > Settings > API & Integrations).\n2. Add an n8n *Header Auth* credential named **Apify API token**: header `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and create a tab named **Openings**.\n4. Put the companies' job-board URLs or domains in **Settings**.\n\nCost: [Career Site Jobs Scraper](https://apify.com/artificially/career-site-jobs-scraper) charges $0.05 per run plus $3.15 per 1,000 jobs.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "db315a0e-c2a0-45f2-a80b-0f5396819f83",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "a4a2b555-7b87-4794-beb7-16b959354810",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "56efd41c-30ba-4a7a-95a4-b00b57073bd0",
              "name": "companies",
              "value": "https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/airbnb, https://jobs.lever.co/spotify, notion.so",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a6643235-d508-40cf-b09f-c4b5b8b4c353",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/artificially~career-site-jobs-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ companies: $json.companies.split(',').map(s => s.trim()).filter(Boolean), onlyNewSinceLastRun: true, includeDescription: false }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "0852c1ea-2abb-4091-9ffe-8b5a12c8adb8",
      "name": "Career Site Jobs Scraper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify API token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(({ json: j }) => ({ json: {\n  jobId: j.jobId,\n  company: j.company?.name ?? j.company,\n  title: j.title,\n  department: j.department,\n  location: j.location,\n  remote: j.isRemote,\n  posted: j.postedAt,\n  firstSeen: new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10),\n  url: j.jobUrl || j.applyUrl,\n} }));"
      },
      "id": "28c7b29f-7aca-4741-87b1-2bbf869213e6",
      "name": "Format",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Openings"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [
            "jobId"
          ],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "RAW"
        }
      },
      "id": "6423e0ba-027e-4d25-bfe9-78c94f852062",
      "name": "Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule": {
